# Production/static-export configuration; next dev does not load this file.
#
# Empty NEXT_PUBLIC_SSE_BASE uses same-origin EventSource paths instead of hardcoded :8787.
# Go serves the static export directly on :8787 or behind nginx on :80/:8090.
# Same-origin SSE works with proxy_buffering off. A hardcoded :8787 would target an
# externally unreachable loopback-only port and leave live logs/streams empty.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SSE_BASE=
